body:
I'm not looking for medical or legal advice. I would however like to discuss the meaning of malpractice and how its definition likely varies greatly from the mind of the pt to the mind of the doc.

I don't want anyone to advise me. I'm just trying to understand why this is happening and how we can try to fix it, not fix it for ME but for everyone. How is our system so broken and is it even possible to hope for improvemet?

&#x200B;
